    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unknown \u2013 Foggins is a mystery game blending puzzle, adventure, and point\u2011and\u2011click elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the protagonist Vincent Marlowe, following an intriguing main story in search of hidden truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a variety of quirky NPCs and uncover their secret stories through dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790190/extras/0e995ed57634bd8b22918c5ec5056e75.poster.avif?t=1752217411\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790190/extras/0e995ed57634bd8b22918c5ec5056e75.webm?t=1752217411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790190/extras/0e995ed57634bd8b22918c5ec5056e75.mp4?t=1752217411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a rich, detailed environment using point\u2011and\u2011click gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden narratives through conversations with distinctive NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deduce item uses and apply them intuitively via drag\u2011and\u2011drop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fresh, creative puzzles within an immersive storyline.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790190/extras/14ae6964bd330437aefa3cc6cd94c69b.poster.avif?t=1752217411\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790190/extras/14ae6964bd330437aefa3cc6cd94c69b.webm?t=1752217411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790190/extras/14ae6964bd330437aefa3cc6cd94c69b.mp4?t=1752217411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unknown \u2013 Foggins is a mystery game blending puzzle, adventure, and point\u2011and\u2011click elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the protagonist Vincent Marlowe, following an intriguing main story in search of hidden truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a variety of quirky NPCs and uncover their secret stories through dialogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790190/extras/0e995ed57634bd8b22918c5ec5056e75.poster.avif?t=1752217411\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790190/extras/0e995ed57634bd8b22918c5ec5056e75.webm?t=1752217411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790190/extras/0e995ed57634bd8b22918c5ec5056e75.mp4?t=1752217411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a rich, detailed environment using point\u2011and\u2011click gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden narratives through conversations with distinctive NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deduce item uses and apply them intuitively via drag\u2011and\u2011drop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fresh, creative puzzles within an immersive storyline.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790190/extras/14ae6964bd330437aefa3cc6cd94c69b.poster.avif?t=1752217411\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790190/extras/14ae6964bd330437aefa3cc6cd94c69b.webm?t=1752217411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790190/extras/14ae6964bd330437aefa3cc6cd94c69b.mp4?t=1752217411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
